@WebAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5102

### Get every clinic
GET {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/clinics
Accept: application/json

### Get one clinic by id (replace the id with one from the list above)
GET {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/clinics/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

###
